{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Upsert Issue"},"description":"Create or update a TestChimp issue in the current project. Omit issueId and pass title to create. Pass issueId (same flexible formats as get-issue-details) plus patch fields to update \u2014 including status (ACTIVE | IGNORED | FIXED | DUPLICATE | IN_PROGRESS_BUG | ARCHIVED_BUG | BLOCKED) and optional ignoreReason. For /testchimp implement TASK_ISSUE creates: set labels=[\"TestChimp Implement\"] (not source), severity from task priority, category (e.g. FUNCTIONAL), and linkTargets for STORY and/or SCENARIO ordinals. For /testchimp fix issue: set IN_PROGRESS_BUG after applying a code fix; set FIXED only after user confirmation. Optional agentTraceability records CREATED / UPDATED Activity inline. Authenticated via project API key.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"actorType":{"enum":["LOCAL_AGENT","CLOUD_AGENT","local-agent","cloud-agent"],"type":"string"},"addLabels":{"items":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"agentModel":{"type":"string"},"agentTraceability":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"actorType":{"enum":["LOCAL_AGENT","CLOUD_AGENT","local-agent","cloud-agent"],"type":"string"},"agentModel":{"type":"string"},"branchName":{"type":"string"},"cliVersion":{"type":"string"},"gitSha":{"type":"string"},"policyFile":{"type":"string"},"policyVersion":{"type":"string"},"skillVersion":{"type":"string"},"userId":{"type":"string"},"workflowExecutionId":{"type":"string"},"workflowId":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"assignee":{"type":"string"},"branchName":{"type":"string"},"category":{"enum":["ACCESSIBILITY","SECURITY","VISUAL","PERFORMANCE","FUNCTIONAL","NETWORK","USABILITY","COMPATIBILITY","DATA_INTEGRITY","INTERACTION","LOCALIZATION","RESPONSIVENESS","LAYOUT","VISUAL_REGRESSION","MEMORY","PERFORMANCE_REGRESSION